// Title: CreateDump Process Dump
// Rule ID: 515c8be5-e5df-4c5e-8f6d-a4a2f05e4b48
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1036, attack.t1003.001, attack.credential-access
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_createdump_lolbin_execution.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
